# Repo-root .dockerignore -- only api/Dockerfile builds from this
# context (it needs the multi-module Maven reactor: root pom.xml plus the
# rules-engine module api depends on). Trims the build context down to
# what a Java build actually touches; ui and data-platform have
# their own, self-contained build contexts and their own .dockerignore.
.git
.claude
data-platform
reporting
docs
infra
ui
**/target
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
